Author: Danny Milosavljevic <dannym@friendly-machines.com>
Date: 2026-04-23
Subject: Switch fppu source-file open from tinputfile to tdosinputfile
License: expat

`fppu.pas` instantiates `tinputfile` directly when registering source
files. `tinputfile` is the abstract base -- concrete subclasses
(`tdosinputfile`, etc.) provide the actual file I/O. The bootstrap
target uses the DOS variant; instantiate it directly so we never rely
on the abstract base's defaults.

--- a/compiler/fppu.pas	2005-12-04 21:24:46.000000000 +0000
+++ b/compiler/fppu.pas	2026-04-25 11:18:34.358141136 +0000
@@ -756,7 +756,7 @@
                   sources_avail:=false;
                   temp:=' not found';
                 end;
-              hp:=tinputfile.create(hs);
+              hp:=tdosinputfile.create(hs);
               { the indexing is wrong here PM }
               sourcefiles.register_file(hp);
             end;
